><div class="grid grid-2">${keys.map(k=>meter(ATTRS[k],c.attrs[k])).join('')}</div></div>`).join('')}<div class="section-head"><div><h2 class="section-title">Trayectoria de clubes</h2><div class="section-note">Equipos que han sido parte de la historia.</div></div></div><div class="card"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">${c.clubs.map((x,i)=>`<span class="tag ${x===c.club?'lime':''}">${i+1}. ${esc(x)}</span>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
